      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Inbox vs Pipeline</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">The inbox is for messages. The pipeline is for sales status. Don''t confuse the two.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Mistake 6: Not Checking Pipeline -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-purple-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Mistake 6: Not Checking Pipeline</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Check Regularly</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">A pipeline that is not checked becomes another forgotten system. Daily check-ins are essential.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">A clean pipeline is easier to use and more likely to bring in business. Avoid too many stages, not moving leads, leaving old leads active, forgetting notes, using inbox as tracker, and not checking regularly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Real-World Practice Exercise</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Review Your Pipeline</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Look at your current pipeline for any of these six mistakes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Identify One Fix</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Find one mistake you can clean up today.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Make the Fix</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Take action to correct the identified mistake.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Common Mistakes to Avoid',
      lesson_number = 10,
      sort_order = 10,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Common Mistakes to Avoid';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Common Mistakes to Avoid

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 5 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 5 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'common-mistakes-avoid' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson common-mistakes-avoid not found in module 5';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is Mistake 1 to avoid?', 
    '["Having too few stages","Creating too many stages","Moving leads too quickly","Checking the pipeline daily"]'::jsonb,
    'Creating too many stages',
    'Mistake 1 is creating too many stages. Too many stages makes the pipeline confusing. Keep it simple with 4-6 clear stages.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Why should you not use the inbox as your sales tracker?', 
    '["The inbox is faster","The inbox is for messages; the pipeline is for sales status","Emails are not important","The inbox shows more information"]'::jsonb,
    'The inbox is for messages; the pipeline is for sales status',
    'The inbox is for messages and conversations. The pipeline is for tracking sales status. They serve different purposes - don''t confuse them.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What should you do with old leads who are not moving forward?', 
    '["Leave them in active stages forever","Move them to Lost or inactive stages","Delete their contact record","Ignore them"]'::jsonb,
    'Move them to Lost or inactive stages',
    'If someone is not moving forward, move them to Lost or another inactive stage. This keeps your active pipeline clean and focused on real opportunities.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
